# Purpose
Helps users troubleshoot incomplete data, formula display problems, unexpected
formula values, invisible changes, and unsupported changes.

# Key Sections
- Data looks incomplete.
- Formulas show as text.
- Formulas return unexpected values.
- Changes are not visible yet.
- A change is not supported.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Troubleshooting should identify likely checks and next steps without
  presenting guesses as confirmed causes.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
